ed-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KOWA CO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YABUSAKI KATSUMI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOWA COMPANY, LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YABUSAKI, KATSUMI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YABUSAKI KATSUMI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YABUSAKI, KATSUMI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A method and device for automatically determining only the pollen in a given amount of atmosphere. Particles whose size is substantially smaller than that of pollen are separated and removed from the particles in a given amount of atmosphere. The remaining particles are made to flow through a flow cell in such a way that the self-fluorescence of each particle can be measured, and the self-fluorescence of each particle is measured, thereby counting the particles based on the measured values.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne une technique et un dispositif qui permettent de compter automatiquement et uniquement le pollen dans un certain volume d'atmosphère. On sépare les particules dont la taille est sensiblement inférieure à celle du pollen des autres particules contenues dans un certain volume d'atmosphère. Puis on fait passer les particules restantes dans une cuve à circulation, de façon à mesurer la fluorescence spontanée de chaque particule; on mesure ladite fluorescence; et on compte les particules en se basant sur les valeurs mesurées.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>